menu "Deskstrate core"

    config DESKSTRATE_DDC_BRINGUP
        bool "DDC1 bring-up logger"
        default y
        help
            Logs DDC/CI (0x37) and EDID (0x50) ACKs, VCP 0x60/0xD6 and the EDID
            serial on DDC1 every 5 s. Read-only.

    config DESKSTRATE_DDC_TOGGLE_TEST
        bool "Toggle-test DDC1 lines at boot"
        depends on DESKSTRATE_DDC_BRINGUP
        default n
        help
            Before starting I2C, drives SDA then SCL low/high for 3 s each (2 cycles)
            so you can follow them with a meter on HDMI pins 16/15.

endmenu
